Z||000014||avengador1||11-01-2001||06:59 PM||||I have a Pioneer supertuner III CD player and it sounded alright, with the replacement Kenwood speakers I put in, but I wanted more bass. I was going to modify a factory sud enclosure with a better speaker and an amp. I found a faster and better solution at Crutchfield. What I found was the Kenwood WOOX. A powered subwoofer that fit(tight) right in the wheelwell and still left room for your feet. It really makes a difference in the low end of the sound. <P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Avendgador1.jpg"> ||||reg||1
